> build-house-style · deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud
Bound the bar keys in `internal/docker/appbar.go`: `/` menu, `[` back, `]` next, `C` contents, `R` drift, `Shift+R` reload, `H` hide, with a menu showing the hints.

The bar moved to a served asset (`/__once/bar.js`) written into the site copy at deploy, because the inline markup outgrew nginx's 4 KB config-token limit. `make test` passes; `make lint` reports 0 issues. Committed as `1b1f9fd split: 16-bar-keys`.
